rule word_scoring:
    """Hybrid GoodScents / word-embedding score of the free odor descriptions, comparison between odors, Fig. 4C/D and the neural-behavior correlation (SI 3.1).
    Needs sentence-transformers (envs/embeddings.yml) and, the first time, internet access for the model."""
